# A situation where two things are changed at once
#: ''The dance included an intricate '''double switch'''.''
# {{lb|en|baseball}} When two players are [[replaced]] [[simultaneously]], typically so that a [[fielder]] can hit in the [[pitcher|pitcher's]] spot in the [[batting order]].
#: ''They did a '''double switch''' after the eighth so that Jones could bat second in the ninth.''